+   $$ \mathbf{qvec} = \mathbf{T} \times \mathbf{e}_1 $$
+8. Compute the second barycentric coordinate $v$:
+   $$ v = (\mathbf{D} \cdot \mathbf{qvec}) \times inv\_det $$
