+   $$ t = (\mathbf{e}_2 \cdot \mathbf{qvec}) \times inv\_det $$
+   - If $t < \epsilon$ (or $t \le 0$), the intersection is behind the ray origin or at the origin. Return no intersection [S5, S9, unofficial].
